  - m_Id: 41385915678466048
    m_Localized: Stronger guy, more passionate battle!\n\nA warlike and unstoppable
      charging explorer.\nThrough battle, he wants to test his limits and prove his
      strength.\n\nIf he takes damage, gains 1 Rage at the end of the turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466049
    m_Localized: Kaya
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466050
    m_Localized: A shaky sword tip only invites death.\n\nA calm and cool-headed
      investigator.\nContinuously learning all combat techniques and seeking to reach
      the pinnacle of swordsmanship.\n\nWhen acting twice in one slot, gain 1 momentum
      at the end of the turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466051
    m_Localized: Hayes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466052
    m_Localized: Nia, please don't fall from my side!\n\nYou are a timid and timid
      explorer.\nYou fight with your summons to overcome your weakness.\n\nIf you
      spend 8 or more costs in one turn, you acquire 1 Ether at the end of the turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466053
    m_Localized: Ines
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466054
    m_Localized: Ines, the gentle executioner\n\nShe looks after her allies with
      a bright face.\nShe embraces her allies affectionately, but even her smile
      turns cold in the face of those who threaten them.\n\nIf a beneficial effect
      is given to an ally, gains 1 Faith at the end of the turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466055
    m_Localized: Raina
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466056
    m_Localized: Rayna, Moonlight Wanderer\n\nShe talks little, but is a free-spirited
      vampire.\nShe steps forward without hesitation when it comes to her heart.\n\nIf
      you damage an enemy with an attack, gain 1 blood at the end of the turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466057
    m_Localized: Merck
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466058
    m_Localized: Move to the\nnearest character.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466059
    m_Localized: When the division value reaches 0, it splits into 2 \n blobs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466060
    m_Localized: Blob
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466061
    m_Localized: Move to the\nnearest character.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466062
    m_Localized: When moving, \n residue is created at the location passed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466063
    m_Localized: Lancer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466064
    m_Localized: When the character gets close,\nmoves away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466065
    m_Localized: Grants\nGrudge to all monsters every turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466066
    m_Localized: Blight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466067
    m_Localized: When the character gets close,\nmoves away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466068
    m_Localized: Grants \n_erosion to all characters every turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466069
    m_Localized: Vespa
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466070
    m_Localized: You can move \n up to 2 times per turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466071
    m_Localized: Move in the same line as the character and rush.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466072
    m_Localized: Cinder
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466073
    m_Localized: Move to the\nnearest character.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466074
    m_Localized: When the explosion value reaches 0, \n explodes and deals damage.
