      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466090
    m_Localized: Arabella
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466091
    m_Localized: When the character gets closer, \nmoves in the opposite direction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466092
    m_Localized: Disables the use of one random slot each turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466093
    m_Localized: Move
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466094
    m_Localized: Moves to the selected grid. Cost is consumed equal to the number
      of spaces moved.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466095
    m_Localized: Cost is consumed equal to the number of spaces moved.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466096
    m_Localized: Move+
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466097
    m_Localized: Moves to the selected grid. You can move up to 2 spaces with 1 cost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466098
    m_Localized: Moves up to 2 spaces with 1 cost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466099
    m_Localized: Bond
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466100
    m_Localized: If your Rage is at maximum, you gain 4 Armor at the start of your
      turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466101
    m_Localized: When you take damage, you gain Rage, and when Rage is maxed, you
      gain 4 Armor at the start of the turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466102
    m_Localized: Belligerence
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466103
    m_Localized: If your Rage is at maximum, you gain 1 boost at the start of your
      turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466104
    m_Localized: When you receive damage, you gain Rage, and when Rage is maxed,
      you gain 1 amplification at the start of the turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466105
    m_Localized: Calmness
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466106
    m_Localized: If momentum is at maximum, an additional cost of 1 is recovered
      at the start of the turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466107
    m_Localized: Gain momentum by acting twice in one slot, and recover an additional
      cost of 1 at the start of the turn when momentum is maximum.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466108
    m_Localized: Insight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466109
    m_Localized: If your momentum is at maximum, gain 1 haste at the start of your
      turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466110
    m_Localized: Gain momentum when you act twice in one slot, and gain 1 haste at
      the start of the turn when momentum is maximum.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466111
    m_Localized: Relief
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466112
    m_Localized: If your Ether is at max, you gain 3 Armor at the start of your turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466113
    m_Localized: If you spend 8 or more costs in one turn, you get ether, and when
      you max out ether, you get 3 armor at the start of the turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466114
    m_Localized: Resolve
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466115
    m_Localized: If Ether is at maximum, grants 3 Armor to the ally with the lowest
      health at the start of the turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466116
    m_Localized: If you use a cost of 8 or more in one turn, you will receive ether,
      and when ether is maxed out, grant 3 defense to the ally with the lowest health
      at the start of the turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466117
    m_Localized: Compassionateness
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466118
    m_Localized: If your faith is at maximum, restore 1 health to the ally with the
      lowest health at the start of the turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466119
    m_Localized: When you give a beneficial effect to an ally, you gain faith, and
      when faith is maxed, the lowest health ally recovers 1 stamina at the start
      of the turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466120
    m_Localized: Referee
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466121
    m_Localized: If your Faith is at maximum, you gain 1 Strike at the start of your
      turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466122
    m_Localized: When you give a beneficial effect to an ally, you gain Faith, and
      when Faith is maxed, you gain 1 Strike at the start of the turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466123
    m_Localized: Bloodlust
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466124
    m_Localized: If your blood energy is at maximum, you gain 1 blood absorption
      at the start of the turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466125
    m_Localized: When you damage an enemy with an attack, you gain blood energy,
      and when blood energy is maxed, you gain 1 vampire at the start of the turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466126
    m_Localized: Nightmare
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466127
    m_Localized: If your blood energy is at maximum, you get an amplification of
      1 at the start of your turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466128
    m_Localized: When you damage an enemy with an attack, you gain blood energy,
      and when blood energy is maxed, you gain 1 amplification at the start of the
      turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466129
    m_Localized: Dragon's Protection
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466130
    m_Localized: Grants 6 armor to you and your allies with the power of the dragon.
    m_Metadata:
